    "dr.sub": "Data Reinvention brings together the strategic, governance, quality, analytical and human dimensions of data into a single integrated practice. Each service is designed to address a specific layer of that complexity, and to deliver value independently or as part of a broader transformation programme.<br><br>It is the end-to-end advisory practice designed to establish a clear baseline of your organisation's current data maturity and define the roadmap for a comprehensive, sustainable transformation across every layer of how data is owned, governed and exploited throughout its full lifecycle.",

